      "content": "the \"minor administrative issue\" thing might still trigger them to ask too many questions. they're super picky about transparency. \n\nis there any way we can just say it's \"cleared customs\" or \"in final transit stages\" instead? if we can convince them it's already moving, we avoid the penalty and the headache. what do u think? is that something we can safely say to buy us some time?",
